(A short guide to the Brookline Public Schools staffing numbers that come up most often in budget discussions.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 476 Td
15 TL
(Several Brookline staffing figures circulate in budget conversations, and they can look) Tj
T* (contradictory at first glance. Most of the confusion comes from mixing reports that count) Tj
T* (different things.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 411 Td
15 TL
(DESE district-profile reports use narrower categories such as total enrollment, educator) Tj
T* (FTE, or teachers by program area. Brookline's FY27 school budget uses a broader staffing) Tj
T* (chart that counts all staff regardless of funding source.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
54 346 Td
15 TL
(That is why DESE can show about 54 special education teachers while the PSB budget shows) Tj
T* (386.1 FTE in its broader Special Education category. The same caution applies to claims) Tj
T* (about administrators: the FY27 budget's 216.4 district-personnel figure is a district office) Tj
T* (staffing total, not a count of administrators alone.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
54 260 Td
16 TL
(Key point: numbers that look inconsistent are often counting different groups of people.) Tj
ET
